    "title": "Ocean City's DaVinci's by the Sea Closes After 40 Years on the Boardwalk - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Aubrey Green ,\n21 hours ago DaVinci's by the Sea served its final plate of Italian comfort food Thursday evening, closing the doors on a 40-year run along the Ocean City Boardwalk. The oceanfront restaurant, tucked into the ground level of the historic Harrison Hall Hotel at 1501 Atlantic Avenue on 15th Street, had already announced that 2026 would be its last season before wrapping up service for good this week. Read full article",
